use data-c=\"D7\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-D7\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mtext\" style=\"font-family: Roboto,'Tiro Devanagari Hindi','Tiro Bangla',sans-serif;\" transform=\"translate(20952,0)\"><text data-variant=\"-explicitFont\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\" font-size=\"884px\">Original Stress</text></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container></p>\n\n<p>Thus, the stress in the leg increases by a factor of 9. Therefore, the correct answer is:</p>\n\n<p>Option B: 9</p></p>","qKey":"5Fr2EmRJzoJz60RU","paperKey":"jee-main-2017-offline","exam":"jee-main","questions":[{"question_id":"5Fr2EmRJzoJz60RU","paperTitle":"JEE Main 2017 (Offline)","year":2017,"subject":"physics","chapter":"properties-of-matter","chapterGroup":"mechanics","type":"mcq","marks":4,"negMarks":1,"content":"A man grows into a giant such that his linear dimensions increase by a factor of 9. Assuming that his\ndensity remains same, the stress in the leg will change by a factor of : ","options":[{"identifier":"A","content":"<mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.816ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"2.595ex\" height=\"2.773ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -864.9 1147.1 1225.5\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mfrac\"><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(396.8,394) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"31\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-31\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" transform=\"translate(220,-345) scale(0.707)\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mn\"><use data-c=\"38\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-38\"></use><use data-c=\"31\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-31\" transform=\"translate(500,0)\"></use></g></g><rect width=\"907.1\" height=\"60\" x=\"120\" y=\"220\"></rect></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>"},{"iden